<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCare downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCare downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp said Tuesday it trimmed earnings estimates and downgraded its rating on PacifiCare Health Systems Inc after the California company said it expected its second quarter earnings to fall below analysts' consensus estimate of $1.16 a share.</p>
<p>PacifiCare cited poor performance in some of the markets served by its FHP International unit and weaker than expected results in California.</p>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago said it lowered its earnings estimates to $4.25 and $5.00 for 1997 and 1998 from $4.85 and $6.00, respectively.</p>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago also downgraded PacifiCare shares to a hold rating from a buy.</p>
